Y2  - 2026/10/09
TI  - The role of character education in learning during the COVID-19 pandemic
JF  - Jurnal Penelitian Ilmu Pendidikan
JA  - JPIP
VL  - 13
IS  - 2
SE  - Articles
DO  - 10.21831/jpipfip.v13i2.32979
